\label{tab:lomo_full}
\scriptsize
\begin{tabular*}{\columnwidth}{@{\extracolsep{\fill}}lrrrr@{}}
\toprule
Benchmark & $G_\text{full}$ & CV (\%) & Max $|\Delta G|$ & Most impactful \\
\midrule
